   "description": "A nostalgic twist on modern charging. Pop Cable combines the classic, coiled design of landline phones with today's universal USB-C standard. Retracting from a compact 1ft to an extended 4ft, it delivers tangle-free, Power Delivery charging up to 60W for all your devices.\n\nFor Samsung Galaxy, Google Pixel, iPhone 15 and later, tablets, laptops &amp; all your USB-C devices\nCoiled, retractable design enables a tangle-free charging experience &amp; a flexible length between 1ft to 4ft*\nHigh-speed charging up to 60W for USB-C laptops &amp; fast-charges your iPhone up to 50% iPhone in under 30 mins\nMade better for the Earth with 100% recycled TPU\n\nAlso available in POP Cable XL\n\n\n*Recommended usable length up to 4ft\n\n\n",
